Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 20:17:50 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] coop-network-context

Guest ports: socket/bind 0x82462350/0x8246238C (1000), 0x82462AF8/0x82462B6C (1001), 0x82462560 (1002); plan-coop generated-disassembly references and section 7. Original serverless implementation; peer routing differs from fork master-service lookup deliberately. Validation: not yet built or runtime traced; subsequent transport fixture evidence required. Author: Codex.
